---
description: Legacy entry point for canonical agent memory
---

Read AGENTS.md, .agent/status.md, .agent/plan.md, .agent/decisions.md, and .agent/rules/coding.md first.
Select contextual rules according to the paths being edited:

| Path | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| src/project_name/core/** | .agent/rules/core.md |
| src/pipelines/** | .agent/rules/pipelines.md |
| src/project_name/infrastructure/** | .agent/rules/infrastructure.md |
| config/** | .agent/rules/config.md |
| tests/** | .agent/rules/testing.md plus the rule for the mirrored package |

Native Cursor path matching is configured in .cursor/rules/*.mdc. This legacy entry point instructs
readers to select rules and does not require a custom frontmatter loader.
